``
inner callback CC: 1 + 2(&) + 1(it &&) = 4ish. outer 1. Good. Pure — no github calls.

```js
function numericPrs(openPrList) {
   return openPrList.filter(function (pr) {
       var n = parseInt(pr && pr.number, 10);
       return !isNaN(n) && n > 0;
