}
``
Pure.

```js
function mapLabeledPrsToIssues(ctx-ish args...) 
``
This one calls `isIssueOpen` (github_get_issue) — must preserve call ORDER: for each labeled pr (in openPrs order), if hasLabel → extract → isIssueOpen (only when n !== null). Current code: `if (n !== null && isIssueOpen(owner, name, n))` — short-circuit: isIssueOpen called only if n !== null. Preserve.

```js
function scanLabeledPrs(openPrs, label, owner, name, seen, log, say) {
   var orphanPrs = [];
   openPrs.forEach(function (pr) {
       if (!hasLabel(pr, label)) return;
       var prn = parseInt(pr.number, 10);
