But hmm — this condition is convoluted: `raw !== '' || typeof fields[fieldName] === 'string'`. Equivalent cleaner form:

```js
var raw = fields[fieldName];
if (typeof raw === 'string') return raw;
if (raw && typeof raw.value === 'string') return raw.value;
``

